# Allow-list: only original skills are tracked. Everything else here is a symlink to
# another package (korean-contracts, orchestrate), Anthropic's synced skills, a local copy
# of a third-party skill (contract-review-questions, unlicensed upstream), or tool state.
# A new original skill needs its own `!/<name>/` line.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/address-pr-comments/
!/cleanup-worktree/
!/loop-pr-comments/

# local backups and caches
*.bak
*.bak-*
__pycache__/
